{
  "description": "A session's characters and worlds can't reuse an ID of the bundle's characters, worlds or scenarios (Format 2.3, 15.3): a header character with a bundle character's ID, or a header world with one, is DUPLICATE_ID, located at the session's ID, which comes later in the comparison order",
  "bundle": {
    "kind": "bundle",
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": "kai",
